@host = http://localhost:5048

### seed one expense (table starts empty)
# @name seed
POST {{host}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "amount": 42.50,
  "description": "Coffee at COOP",
  "expenseDate": "2026-09-01"
}

### validation: bad category -> 400 (was 500)
POST {{host}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 99, "amount": 10.00, "description": "bad", "expenseDate": "2026-09-01" }

### validation: future date -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 1, "amount": 10.00, "description": "future", "expenseDate": "2099-01-01" }

### filter (case-insensitive search)
GET {{host}}/api/expenses?search=coop

### sort
GET {{host}}/api/expenses?sortBy=amount&sortDirection=asc

### pagination envelope
GET {{host}}/api/expenses?page=1&pageSize=2

### dashboard summary
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/summary?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31

### dashboard by-category
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/by-category?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31

### dashboard by-day
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/by-day?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30

### dashboard top-expenses
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/top-expenses?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31